# Kashyyyk, Chuundar's way (K1): Freyyr given the blade and brought back
# up as on the main route, but at the throne the party sides with
# Chuundar and turns Zaalbar against his father; Freyyr falls, Chuundar
# keeps his throne, and Zaalbar leaves with the party and Bacca's sword.
# Starts from the main route's checkpoint after the ritual (the blade
# found):
#   kjk playthrough k1 @kas_ritual data/routes/k1/kashyyyk_chuundar.route --god
say found the blade      # Freyyr, Zaalbar's father: the blade of Bacca's sword
say here, take it
use kas25_freyyr_01      # feral after his years below: he fights,
talk
fight 20                 # beaten near to death, he hears the party out
talk
save kch_freyyr
exit Exit                # back up to the Upper Shadowlands
to 56.4,205.4            # past the tach standing by the slope's foot on its
to 56.6,200.5            # free side (as kashyyyk)
use kas24_gorwook_01     # Gorwooken at the lift
talk
fight 20
use kas24_baskettalk     # up to the Great Walkway
talk
module kas_m22ab
save kch_walkway_back
say side with chuundar   # Rwookrrorro: Freyyr's return; the party with
say yes! freyyr abandoned you  # Chuundar, Zaalbar turned on his father
exit kas22_towndoor
talk
fight 30
talk                     # Chuundar's thanks: Bacca's sword for Zaalbar
save kch_throne
if in kas_m23ad          # out, onto the Great Walkway (where the scene's
exit KashyyykDoor2       # end has not already put the party)
end
exit KashyyykDoor3       # the landing port
exit EbonHawk            # aboard
use GalaxyMap            # the galaxy map: Manaan
travel 6
module stunt_00          # the vision (stunt_00),
module ebo_m12aa         # landed in Ahto City's docking bay
talk
save kch_manaan
